r":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165118931,"discussion_id":"63bba72d02419ddfe9240a323f2df6f1f23656d2","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复卷积算子（conv2d_v2）在非组优化预加载（non-groupOptPreload）场景下的逻辑错误。该错误导致内核代码中 `groupOptIter` 参数未被正确重置，从而影响输入数据加载偏移量的计算，可能引发数据加载错误或计算结果异常。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n在卷积算子的核心数据加载函数 `LoadAL1` 中，针对非组优化预加载场景，显式地将 `groupOptIter` 参数重置为 0。此修改确保了内核代码在该场景下偏移量计算的正确性，避免了因参数值错误导致的内存访问或逻辑分支问题。","created_at":"2026-03-12T21:46:39+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-12T21:46:39+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165119015,"discussion_id":"598636d64c1bd13257cd0ff729aefdf7cb307790","body":"compile\n","created_at":"2026-03-12T21:47:30+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-12T21:47:30+08:00","user":{"id":"69241f243197e961bc360dbb","login":"zhangxiyan7","object_id":"69241f243197e961bc360dbb","name":"zhangxiyan7","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ef/fa/e452786286f572804f1879afcb69203bfb73ad880d3dfdb183526e0241c441ec.jpg","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/zhangxiyan7"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165131398,"discussion_id":"7b0dc340643301e4e22d16fdb8bd1cf9df329c18","body":"compile\n","created_at":"2026-03-13T08:58:00+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-13T08:58:00+08:00","user":{"id":"69241f243197e961bc360dbb","login":"zhangxiyan7","object_id":"69241f243197e961bc360dbb","name":"zhangxiyan7","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/ef/fa/e452786286f572804f1879afcb69203bfb73ad880d3dfdb183526e0241c441ec.j